THIRD-PARTY NOTICES — bundled icon sets
=======================================

The animated-icon motion primitives in this plugin animate static SVGs sourced
from permissively-licensed icon sets. The icons themselves are third-party
artwork; only sets whose license permits redistribution are bundled here. Each
bundled `*.svg` and its entry in `icons.json` retains the license below.

This file is also appended to by `scripts/fetch_icon.py` (the Iconify puller),
which adds one entry per pulled set the first time an icon from that set is
fetched into a project. The puller refuses any set not on its permissive
allowlist, so nothing license-incompatible can land next to these notices.

